            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Section\u202f1109(b) provides parties in interest a voice in bankruptcy proceedings; an insurer with financial responsibility for bankruptcy claims is a party in interest that may object to a Chapter\u202f11 plan of reorganization."
      }
